   "no": 2,
   "en": "INTERVENTION",
   "title": "当前程序实现了什么",
   "html": "<p>用有符号非线性压差模型进行参数扫描，比较上下边界而不提供现场速度设定。 这是明确写出的物理或规则模型，没有训练神经网络，也没有在线下发控制动作。输入改变后，程序重新计算所有图表和指标。</p><p>ΔP=sign(v)×0.8(D/2500)(30/gap)²(|v|/0.5)^1.5 MPa；P井底=0.00981ρD+ΔP。v 为 m/s、gap 为 mm、D 为 m、ρ 为 g/cm³。0.8 MPa、指数 1.5 与 0.0118/0.0148 MPa/m 窗口梯度均为教学假设，并非现场水力学关联式。</p><div class='figure'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 720 150' role='img' aria-label='录入教学输入，按公开公式求解，扫描并比较结果，恢复默认复现'><defs><marker id='d11-flow' markerWidth='8' markerHeight='8' refX='6' refY='4' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L8 4L0 8Z' fill='#41699b'/></marker></defs><rect x='12' y='38' width='160' height='62' rx='8' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.07' stroke='#41699b'/><text x='92' y='73' text-anchor='middle' fill='#202b38' font-size='12'>录入教学输入</text><path d='M174 69h12' stroke='#41699b' marker-end='url(#d11-flow)'/><rect x='190' y='38' width='160' height='62' rx='8' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.07' stroke='#41699b'/><text x='270' y='73' text-anchor='middle' fill='#202b38' font-size='12'>按公开公式求解</text><path d='M352 69h12' stroke='#41699b' marker-end='url(#d11-flow)'/><rect x='368' y='38' width='160' height='62' rx='8' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.07' stroke='#41699b'/><text x='448' y='73' text-anchor='middle' fill='#202b38' font-size='12'>扫描并比较结果</text><path d='M530 69h12' stroke='#41699b' marker-end='url(#d11-flow)'/><rect x='546' y='38' width='160' height='62' rx='8' fill='#2875c7' fill-opacity='.07' stroke='#41699b'/><text x='626' y='73' text-anchor='middle' fill='#202b38' font-size='12'>恢复默认复现</text></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>计算流程</b><span>每次输入同步计算；动效只帮助解释过程，不决定求解结果。</span></div>"
